<span id="Properties"></span>
==Vlastnosti==

See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

A PartDesign AdditiveLoft object is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part Feature]] object and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

===Data===

{{TitleProperty|Loft}}

* {{PropertyData|Sections|LinkSubList}}: lists the sections used.
* {{PropertyData|Ruled|Bool}}: see [[#Options|Options]].
* {{PropertyData|Closed|Bool}}: see [[#Options|Options]].

{{TitleProperty|Part Design}}

See [[PartDesign_Pad#Data|PartDesign Pad]].

{{TitleProperty|Side1}}

* {{PropertyData|Up To Face|LinkSub}}: non applicable.
* {{PropertyData|Up To Shape|LinkSubList}}

{{TitleProperty|Side2}}

* {{PropertyData|Up To Face2|LinkSub}}: {{Version|1.1}}
* {{PropertyData|Up To Shape2|LinkSubList}}: {{Version|1.1}}

{{TitleProperty|Sketch Based}}

* {{PropertyData|Profile|LinkSub}}: the base profile object of the loft.
* {{PropertyData|Midplane|Bool}}: non applicable.
* {{PropertyData|Reversed|Bool}}: non applicable.
* {{PropertyData|Allow Multi Face|Bool}}: non applicable.


